### Builds Specific Ignores
# Ignore the entire Builds folder
Builds/
Builds/MacOSX/
Builds/VisualStudio2017/
Builds/VisualStudio2019/
Builds/VisualStudio2022/

# EXCEPTION: Unignore the LinuxMakefile subfolder and all its contents
!Builds/LinuxMakefile/

### Juce Specific
# JuceLibraryCode/ (Commented out - these files MUST be tracked for CI/CD)
# NOTE: If any other specific Juce-generated files consistently appear and should NOT be tracked,
# add them here, but be careful not to ignore essential source code.

# Boost library (ignore everything except boost.zip)
Source/Misc/boost/
!Source/Misc/boost/boost.zip
!Source/Misc/boost/boost-version-info.txt
.DS_Store

### Other project-specific ignores
# Ignore the Panels directory and its contents
Panels/
# If 'Panels' can also exist as a file in root and needs ignoring, use this
# /Panels

# Steinberg VST2 SDK ignores
Source/Misc/vst2sdk/

### macOS Specific Files
# macOS directory metadata
.DS_Store
Builds/MacOSX/build/Release/libCtrlrX.a
Builds/MacOSX/CtrlrX.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/DYREC.xcuserdatad/UserInterfaceState.xcuserstate
Source/Core/CtrlrRevision.h
.vs/

### LuaJIT precompiled bundles for Projucer builds
# CI-produced, tracked so a Projucer user needs no CMake -- see Doc/LUAJIT.md.
# Track the zips and their manifests only; the extracted contents are recreated
# by each build's pre-build step and must never be committed. Note the `*` in
# the first pattern: a trailing `/` would stop git descending into the directory
# and the negations below would never fire.
Source/Misc/luajit/precompiled/*
!Source/Misc/luajit/precompiled/*.zip
!Source/Misc/luajit/precompiled/*.json
!Source/Misc/luajit/precompiled/README.md
